# Centurion — keyboard lighting.
#
#   Spectrum per-key RGB (ITE 8258): USB 048d:c1xx (Gen10), c9xx (Gen7-9,
#   Legion 9), c6xx (LOQ Gen10, Legion 5 Gen11)
#   4-zone RGB keyboard:             USB 048d:c9xx
#
# Grants the active local session access to the controller's hidraw node
# (uaccess: systemd-logind or elogind), so the Lighting tab, the tray and
# scenes change lighting without pkexec. Without this rule lighting-helper
# still works through pkexec. Sorted before 73-seat-late.rules, which is
# where the uaccess tag is acted on. The helper itself only ever talks to the
# interface whose HID descriptor declares the expected feature report.
SUBSYSTEM=="hidraw", ATTRS{idVendor}=="048d", ATTRS{idProduct}=="c1??", TAG+="uaccess"
SUBSYSTEM=="hidraw", ATTRS{idVendor}=="048d", ATTRS{idProduct}=="c6??", TAG+="uaccess"
SUBSYSTEM=="hidraw", ATTRS{idVendor}=="048d", ATTRS{idProduct}=="c9??", TAG+="uaccess"
